   "widgets_values": [
    "Wide establishing shot of ONE new original environment: [DESCRIPTION — ex. a small alpine research outpost on a rocky ridge at dawn, modular metal cabins, antennas, low clouds in the valley].\n\nUse Picture 1, Picture 2 and Picture 3 only as a moodboard: architecture and shape language from Picture 1, materials, textures and vegetation from Picture 2, color palette, lighting and mood from Picture 3. Take only design inspiration from them.\n\nEye-level camera at human height, straight horizon, level camera, 24mm lens, deep focus, the whole scene sharp. Clear and readable lighting from a single main light source. No people, no text, no watermark."
